<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.50 vs   0.78</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.84 vs   1.09</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.66 vs   1.11</p>
<p> Sales		   11.88 vs   8.85</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.12 vs   4.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.94 vs   7.42</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.41 vs   6.74</p>
<p> Sales		  121.23 vs  68.78</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish software firm is Computerland</p>
<p>Poland SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
